gonna run on powder.

1012
00:48:15.398 --> 00:48:16.983
That sounds like paradise.

1013
00:48:18.318 --> 00:48:19.402
Someone's gonna
own the pipeline.

1014
00:48:19.485 --> 00:48:20.612
I want it to be you.

1015
00:48:20.695 --> 00:48:22.655
My supply.
Your streets.

1016
00:48:24.073 --> 00:48:25.575
Fifty-fifty.

1017
00:48:25.658 --> 00:48:27.201
What the fuck did you just say?

1018
00:48:29.579 --> 00:48:31.914
Fifty-fifty.
It's pretty nice. right?

1019
00:48:33.166 --> 00:48:34.292
And what would
your boss think?

1020
00:48:34.375 --> 00:48:35.960
Castellano's a dinosaur.

1021
00:48:36.044 --> 00:48:37.587
He's still acting
like it's 1952.

1022
00:48:37.670 --> 00:48:40.590
and he's peddling olive oil
out of a fuckin' Buick.

1023
00:48:40.673 --> 00:48:43.593
At least your guy Sweeney was
willing to experiment.

1024
00:48:43.676 --> 00:48:46.346
Sweeney's concentrating
on the Javits Center.

1025
00:48:46.429 --> 00:48:48.139
The coke thing was
a one-off.

1026
00:48:48.222 --> 00:48:50.016
-He's not interested.
-Right.

1027
00:48:51.017 --> 00:48:54.145
But you're sittin' on two keys
and a hundred grand.

1028
